We know Portnoy was involved in $LIBRAâ€™s promotionâ€”he admitted to receiving **six million $LIBRA tokens**, though he later claimed to have returned them after realizing the promotional arrangement was less transparent than he had hoped.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8OBtsOl-kbMOFeJDA6HPvYpn4WmfS6eruWI2ZXfjS-8ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;834lSnwcIb7-g228zEAgod0zVQ9JTWsZ79l-wiAvNdYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb62ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iw0B49HqyuTT9CTYUuHuoDtDfTPDFWpsuNPWcg-27kEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fcMXKhLtK0LfQduG_Jl9R9FHu6NU5EZRVJWx5QYAqkQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkfsportsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zThu_4zMsniQQ7QtKOAOmAfTwRQ_ifqKkrtQyRnoue0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx¼The bigger question is:

**Did Barstool Sports use liquidity from its cut as a sportsbook to artificially inflate the $LIBRA token before insiders cashed out?**

