    "content": "---\ntitle: Accountable Agentic Newsrooms Research Agenda\ndescription: A research agenda for warrant-preserving editorial infrastructure, where evidence, attribution, authority, judgment, genre, legal risk, correction, and accountability remain distinguishable as claims move through humans, agents, tools, prose, metadata, feeds, and downstream summaries. Frames the problem as controlled delegation rather than autonomous publication, names fifteen research questions (editorial judgment as gates not functions, authority graphs, source-power modeling, modality preservation, headline pragmatics, correction propagation, settlement of contested evidence, demand-not-evidence, genre contracts, omission ledgers, adversarial threat models), and proposes technical artifacts and a prioritized roadmap.\ndate-created: 2026-06-19\ndate-modified: 2026-06-19\ntags: [agentic-newsroom, editorial-judgment, gate-algebra, authority-graph, source-power, modality-preservation, headline-pragmatics, correction-propagation, settlement, demand-not-evidence, genre-contract, omission-ledger, adversarial-editorial, controlled-delegation]\n---\n\n# Accountable Agentic Newsrooms: A Research Agenda for Warrant-Preserving Editorial Infrastructure\n\n## Source note\n\nThis research agenda was prepared from three early memos supplied by the user:\n\n- `news_topology_research_memo.md`\n- `fiber-algebra-editorial-production.md`\n- `claims_to_prose_research_report.md`\n\nIt also draws on journalism studies, editorial standards, computational journalism, provenance systems, structured news standards, discourse pragmatics, fact-checking research, and AI/agentic-ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PjQ-zJMo3kaoPDEFiiYOarufWanQ3fm5PnOBw_VPFk8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;e6GnKhYCuUBs1pP-iNtPFk_qqcbTIf537KycReCZ8Mgƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;gT8R6j3Hj9hgs48JVynWw3afCiHMt4UTC6zemkouCVwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd9641ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jJyfAFKwkGbPadIs0sOYj0q_o4DG8xxch_hMNXAG7LQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;LHxjdwv7kqk895GTg_2qCvvtawIVUuiYlVvFKHB2ZWMƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;aXsNKAVyYsMDCuHfLlsbw3POQ0GppUjyREJ3YM-hrnsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;hqCvq3Y_siB6mYGHtcx30MdjpEdDODqYfSPWiot_RiAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;p3EsZcPkFXWp1YtRy0O7M0bU8Wdg0mgFPq4hczcW8CUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkfsportsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;tATyvqD6WJuoSmUleopSS4f7ZapansgTP4nvEYbwIbcƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vdoedYTnFny3TP4PXCD_dZFXU81dxNduoZxmE_OCp_oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjkoios.newsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-hOfV726UIjH9UrH_MuXTZ0uybn7Oo2GpRw0xRaQfSgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkr@emsenn/koios.newsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;RYq5htZyAt8v3wztFuiCM5iOBXsqPfvN7siSV7O6Q14ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxk/home/emsenn/info/lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/rsc-quiescent/services/koios-news/sites/koios.