  rejected: true
  rejection_reason: "Frame never gets grounded â€” the collapse-frame connection between an academic arrest and climate migration stays abstract throughout, never citing actual displacement data or migration figures. The Iran/World Cup citation in section 2 is a stretch: a sports team's flag politics is not evidence of resource-driven border securitization. A rewrite needs a concrete climate-migration data point before the espionage angle can carry the thesis."
